1034	{"artifactId":"ISSUE-ecf8440c29a6aa99","entry":{"id":"user-decision-chunk-scaled-time-v1","text":"User scope addition, 2026-10-27: “the total time budget should also be based on the number of chunks, 10 * #chunk minutes, rather than fixed 20 mins. add this also and go for another round”. This authorizes chunk-scaled total review time and another design review cycle. Per-call limits remain10 minutes; retries do not reset clocks or mint chunks. Total time is recalculated when the actual chunk work plan changes, rather than freezing the first two-chunk20-minute allocation. This supersedes any earlier instruction to leave total job deadline behavior unchanged, not the per-call safety limits.","actor":{"id":"insrc:controller","kind":"agent","properties":{"recordingExplicitUserInstruction":true}},"timestamp":"2026-10-27T05:47:42.356Z","feedback":[],"kind":"comment","revision":1,"source":{"system":"user-chat","externalId":"2026-10-27-chunk-scaled-review-time"},"anchor":{"section":"Governing scope addition: review time"}}}
